    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are pleased to present this attractive 4 bedroom semi detached home located in the sought after area of Springfield drive in  Dooradoyle. No.8 Springfield Drive consists of a entrance hall, livingroom with fireplace, sitting room with gas fire and patio doors, kitchen tiled floor, dining room with rear door, utility room,  hallway with wet room WC, downstairs bedroom/ office. Upstairs consists of the main bathroom and three bedrooms, Stira / folding ladder installed. To the rear there is an enclosed garden. The rear mature garden has a sunny south aspect and with a stone patio area. To the front, the property is accessed by a driveway with gates. The property has double glazed windows and is heated by gas fired central heating system. \r\nSuperbly located being close to all local amenities such as Crescent Shopping Centre, University Hospital Limerick, Raheen Business Park, Mungret Park, national & secondary schools and the M7/M20 motorways via the Shannon tunnel and the N18. Dooradoyle is situated in the suburbs of Limerick city approx. 3km from Limerick city. This property offers an abundance of appeal and potential in a great location, contact Peter Kearney at Rooney's for further information."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\t\r\nEntrance hall : 4.06m x 2.76m\r\nFront living room : 3.57m x 3.87m \r\nRear living room: 3.86m x 3.35m \r\nKitchen: 3.77m x 2.52m \r\nDining room: 3.54m x 2.39m\r\nUtility room: 2.39m x 1.70m \r\nWC/Wet room: 2.39m x 1.80m\r\nBedroom 1: 3.60m x 2.42m \r\nBedroom 2: 3.83 x 3.02m\r\nBedroom 3: 3.89m x 3.25m\r\nBedroom 4: 3.64m x 2.42m\r\nMain Bathroom: 2.32 x 2.42m WC, WHB, Bath\r\nLanding area"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- The Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant available provides up to €50,000 subject to terms and conditions.\r\n- Excellent location.\r\n- Superbly located being close to all local amenities such as Crescent Shopping Centre, University Hospital Limerick, Raheen Business Park.\r\n- Motorway easily accessible.\r\n- Located in established residential area.\r\n- 5 min walk to University Hospital Limerick.\r\n-15 min walk to Raheen Business Park.\r\n- Excellent primary & secondary schools nearby.\r\n- Spacious accommodation with 4 bedrooms. \r\n- Front garden and driveway.\r\n- Rear enclosed garden.\r\n- Great access to public transport.\r\n- Within 1 km of the motorway network.\r\n- Gas fired central heating.\r\n- Double Glazed Windows.\r\n- Built 1968."
      },
